ⲛⲁⲣⲉ	C2509	C	ϫⲉ**ⲛⲁ**ⲩϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟⲥ ϫⲉⲟⲩⲟⲛ ⲟⲩⲡⲛⲉⲩⲙⲁ ⲛⲁⲕⲁⲑⲁⲣⲧⲟⲛ ⲛⲉⲙⲁϥ .	--because they said, 'He has an unclean spirit.'	Bohairic Gospel of Mark 3 (Digital Edition)	urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:3	1	bohairic
