ⲏⲓ	C790	N	ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥⲟⲩⲟⲣⲡϥ ⲉⲡⲉϥ**ⲏⲓ** ⲉϥϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟⲥ ϫⲉⲙⲡⲣϣⲉ ⲛⲁⲕ ⲉϧⲟⲩⲛ ⲉⲡⲓϯⲙⲓ .	He sent him away to his house, saying, 'Don't enter into the village, nor tell anyone in the village.'	Bohairic Gospel of Mark 8 (Digital Edition)	urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:8	0	bohairic
